Hello,

Since v7 has released, I have been trying to find time to upgrade our prod repo into full ESM. 

I am using SWC, targeting to `es6`, module declaration, decorators and everything else has been migrated to v7 and ESM. 

I ran tests, 100% passed. 

Now the only change left in my to-do list was to use TsMorphProvider instead of ReflectMetadata.

Now the error I get is 

`ERROR  Source file './dist/src/modules/test/test.entity.ts' not found. Check your 'entitiesTs' option and verify you have 'compilerOptions.declaration' enabled in your 'tsconfig.json'. If you are using webpack, see https://bit.ly/35pPDNn`


I have looked into other issues related to it, but all the workarounds did not work for me.

Switch back to ReflectMetdataProvider and everything is smooth.


